    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21863" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">imperceptus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inp-</span></b> ), a, um, adj.
